The '''Ancient Ruins''' are a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]], accessible through the Murkwater Depths.

{{ZoneText|Visit the ruins of an ancient temple.}}

== Purpose ==
The '''Ancient Ruins''' serve as an entrance to the {{zone|Forest Temple}}. To enter it, the player needs to right-click several lanterns in the right order, which depends on the amount of sea pickles near them. The coordinates of the lanterns are as follows:

# -641, 56, 48
# -650, 59, 59
# -618, 66, 54
# -633, 73, 65
# -651, 69, 59

